<div class="section_content content" id="7681236_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall be known as "Maintenance of Vacant Buildings" and is supplementary to applicable provisions of the New York State Uniform Fire Prevention and Building Code.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
