        <div class="notes" id="notes-7681237" data-guid="7681237"></div>
        <div id="questions-7681237" data-guid="7681237" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7681237_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article provides standards governing the facilities and the condition and maintenance of vacant premises to safeguard the safety, health and welfare of the community.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
