       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 133-77
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7681278"
    >
Elevators, dumbwaiters and escalators.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7681278" data-guid="7681278"></div>
        <div id="questions-7681278" data-guid="7681278" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7681278_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Elevators, dumbwaiters and escalators shall be maintained or taken out of service, in accordance with ANSI A17.1.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7681279"
      id="7681279"
      data-guid="7681279"
      data-position="3209"
      data-full-title="§ 133-78: Exterior property areas."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7681279_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7681279_label" for="7681279_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7681279"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 133-78
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7681279"
    >
Exterior property areas.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7681279" data-guid="7681279"></div>
        <div id="questions-7681279" data-guid="7681279" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7681279_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7681280"><a alt="133-78A" class="litem_number" href="7681280#7681280" onclick="return false;" title="133-78A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Surface and subsurface water shall be appropriately drained to protect buildings and structures and to prevent ponding.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7681281"><a alt="133-78B" class="litem_number" href="7681281#7681281" onclick="return false;" title="133-78B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Fences, walls, other minor construction and accessory structures shall be maintained in safe, good and substantial condition.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7681282"><a alt="133-78C" class="litem_number" href="7681282#7681282" onclick="return false;" title="133-78C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Steps, walks, driveways, parking spaces and similar paved areas shall be maintained to afford safe and convenient passage.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7681283"><a alt="133-78D" class="litem_number" href="7681283#7681283" onclick="return false;" title="133-78D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Yards, courts and vacant lots shall be kept clean and free of hazards and debris.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7681284"><a alt="133-78E" class="litem_number" href="7681284#7681284" onclick="return false;" title="133-78E">E. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Ground cover shall be properly established to prevent undue soil erosion due to the elements.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7681285"><a alt="133-78F" class="litem_number" href="7681285#7681285" onclick="return false;" title="133-78F">F. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Heavy undergrowth and accumulations of plant growth which are noxious or detrimental to health or safety shall be eliminated.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
